[00:01.696]
[00:02.196]Too much of the past for one to memorize
{"过往纷繁难以尽数铭记"}
[00:15.946]Too many words remained for one to read through the lines
{"字里行间尚余万千未读之语"}
[00:29.196]The ebb and flow of the crowd floods the world and paradise
{"人潮涨落淹没尘世与天堂"}
[00:42.196]Along the path of time
{"沿着时间轨迹"}
[00:48.946]
[00:51.051]Every night brings a dream but the day, relentlessly, keeps me awake
{"每夜梦境翩跹 白昼却无情令我清醒"}
[01:04.196]All the rest will be torn up whenever a choice is made
{"每次抉择都让其余可能支离破碎"}
[01:17.195]Every living soul in the fray striving for their own safe place
{"众生在纷争中追寻各自安身之所"}
[01:31.195]Life is too long to end at a grave
{"生命漫长岂止止于墓碑"}
[01:42.445]
[01:45.619]Just a drop of water suffices
{"仅需一滴水便足矣"}
[01:49.757]Encompassed and swallowed through space by the universe
{"被宇宙时空环抱吞噬"}
[01:55.432]
[01:56.460]Back to the source
{"溯回本源"}
[01:58.405]
[01:58.896]Gone are those years living for a reason
{"为意义而活的岁月已逝"}
[02:02.886]Here it comes the moment of the scene of lost and found
{"失而复得的时刻正来临"}
[02:09.331]
[02:11.289]Personas played out on the stage
{"舞台上演绎的角色"}
[02:17.189]will return to the self when there's a curtain call
{"终将在谢幕时回归本我"}
[02:30.398]
[02:32.797]Every night brings a dream but the day, relentlessly, keeps me awake
{"每夜梦境翩跹 白昼却无情令我清醒"}
[02:46.048]All the rest will be torn up whenever a choice is made
{"每次抉择都让其余可能支离破碎"}
[02:59.048]Everyone has their own desire leading to the ultimate
{"人人皆有指引至终局的渴望"}
[03:13.048]Life is too long to end at a grave
{"生命漫长岂止止于墓碑"}
[03:24.798]
[03:27.548]Just a drop of water suffices
{"仅需一滴水便足矣"}
[03:31.548]Still I wish to embrace the world with my thoughts
{"仍愿以思想拥抱这世界"}
[03:37.297]
[03:38.298]A eulogy
{"一篇悼词"}
[03:40.297]
[03:40.548]Time to leave where I have stood so long
{"该离开这长久驻足之地"}
[03:44.798]Letting you go recover traces overlapped
{"释怀让你重寻重叠印记"}
[03:51.048]
[03:51.598]Ends, then begins.
{"终结 而后新生"}
[03:55.385]
